    {
      "id": "d0859065-7eb4-404b-abc2-cbd605b26491",
      "title": "Compare as duas frases e note o que muda quando o estado do ambiente muda.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 1,
      "sequenceItem": 4,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "50cf1220-6481-4b70-9283-deda2af02ba7",
          "textContent": "<p>Com o mesmo lugar, o espanhol troca apenas a palavra do estado.</p><ul><li><strong>La cocina está sucia.</strong></li><li><strong>La cocina está limpia.</strong></li></ul><p>Isso permite descrever rapidamente como um ambiente da casa está naquele momento.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": null
        }
      ],
      "dialogue_bubbles": null,
      "glossary": null
    },
    {
      "id": "42e0e64f-bc18-47a0-9610-5cd58c0f28cd",
      "title": "Escute as frases e repare no que se lava e no que se limpa.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 3,
      "sequenceItem": 5,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "1f23e6f4-2abf-482c-a44c-c57a12e902e5",
          "textContent": "<p>Quando o foco está nos pratos, aparece uma ação bem concreta.</p><p><strong>Hay que lavar los platos.</strong></p><p>Em português: <strong>É preciso lavar os pratos.</strong></p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/1e489138de524c15a61cecdd3cb0277b_cocina-sucia.png?Expires=1794099506&Signature=hnPux1~k4YXDtwisfDPWWaY7S14TXcbEAne6cPOLD9Oe9rMphe7oPPjmnYJQUKULSkHAnpo-NX5uGvvj6W85lFe3PJDrlL9eLhwRzxgIcCOkFFe0GiWMr3VMm6b5HWEgoieQ~DCecy9x5FL8Mk7lYYjsmTPecv-iqPr54umXfcZBR5UwhCfZmcytkBHny6RAG~6GRvKaE3sphn94EBAxJ6y4vfMhZgBby1VphAWiYnDmw6fSep58FHJGRq4Q8TfSBwNBH3wwyWz4h2nNZspOJbi9pz2pBAC4YG1aOxRuxc0SbQxNrfGS2ritjFHzEuAbNdD4PHH-ujd7yIWXx8VofA__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/be5d138db6654ba482ef7f25f795f598_hay-que-lavar-los-platos.mp3?Expires=1794099506&Signature=dYaZxo0LY9LmLype8rH9DslzQWM75sNEcHs7v1x~JJvFjPKP1kbFJkw81z1guHW2pjz2ELpEuMDoj4h0wItgS4QR57bfnba~I1vjnAntmnXWN~othCwIFBJrkS0l~jTNK92a3vs8fznSj-1n7wt4HGWmlph87-hkLmruOS0472Yvz2AbLX1dUWZYpTn0vGA4KHRj1n2YcTz72R8QfRUWAwMte6ozIGu7rMye1xdmRDUbMR7PRBFiq64sSKPcB4HL0zc3zDa8azu90sagMLNwtSWIw6rwgIeFGHow5q3R~5eAQrXicacQXAhqgdO-hhYwLC565-~xfHKaybSBB80vtQ__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
        },
        {
          "id": "d383ed70-e14f-480d-a3ca-cca4406d3ab4",
          "textContent": "<p>Quando o foco volta para o espaço inteiro, muda a ação.</p><p><strong>Hay que limpiar la cocina.</strong></p><p>Em português: <strong>É preciso limpar a cozinha.</strong></p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/1e489138de524c15a61cecdd3cb0277b_cocina-sucia.png?Expires=1794099506&Signature=hnPux1~k4YXDtwisfDPWWaY7S14TXcbEAne6cPOLD9Oe9rMphe7oPPjmnYJQUKULSkHAnpo-NX5uGvvj6W85lFe3PJDrlL9eLhwRzxgIcCOkFFe0GiWMr3VMm6b5HWEgoieQ~DCecy9x5FL8Mk7lYYjsmTPecv-iqPr54umXfcZBR5UwhCfZmcytkBHny6RAG~6GRvKaE3sphn94EBAxJ6y4vfMhZgBby1VphAWiYnDmw6fSep58FHJGRq4Q8TfSBwNBH3wwyWz4h2nNZspOJbi9pz2pBAC4YG1aOxRuxc0SbQxNrfGS2ritjFHzEuAbNdD4PHH-ujd7yIWXx8VofA__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
